{"change_summary":"Added a direct unit regression for shrimp feeding on the routed organic-matter basis, moving the intake-basis assertion to a pre-reset code path so `daily_food_consumed_g` is checked against the same periphyton-to-organic-matter conversion used by the shrimp routing loop. Verified that the other pending amendments are present and passing in the current workspace state: pre-step invariant validation is read-only, `shrimp_assimilation_efficiency` rejects 0/1 boundary values, and shrimp routing coefficients are validated/materialized through process presets.","outstanding_risks":["`crates/tank_core/tests/shrimp_population.rs` already had unrelated local edits in this workspace; I left them in place and did not reconcile or revert them.","The untracked `.ralph-burning/` directory is still present in the worktree and was left untouched."],"steps":[{"description":"Inspected the shrimp routing path, invariant guard behavior, and process preset materialization against the pending amendment list to determine what still needed code changes versus verification.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Added unit-level coverage in `crates/tank_core/src/systems/shrimp.rs` for the routed intake-mass basis and removed the equivalent integration assertion that was observing `daily_food_consumed_g` after the daily reset.","order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Ran formatting and targeted/full test passes to confirm the shrimp routing, invariant validation, and preset wiring behavior in the current workspace state.","order":3,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`cargo fmt --all` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_data` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_scenarios` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_core --lib shrimp_feeding_tracks_daily_food_on_routing_mass_basis` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test validation --test shrimp_feeding_pathway` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_core` passed in the current workspace state."]}